    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy two empires and smash the duopoly in an adorable, quirky puzzle adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world dominated by <strong>Alphabarn</strong> and <strong>Omegamart</strong>, the twin supermarket overlords of <i>Duopolis</i>, a shopping cart awakens to find themselves abandoned, like so many others - destined to be destroyed and replaced. Teaming up with scrappy, an abandoned receipt, they begin their quest to <i>free</i> <i>all cartkind</i> from the devious plans of the evil duopoly and <strong>forge their own path to freedom.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 LEVELS OF COZY, TURN-BASED PUZZLE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 5 different regions of Duopolis - each with their own quirks, characters and challenges. From the forest to the carpark, the supermarket to the sewers and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/a6c5a9c641ce125a5718e2fa6e205fd5.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH THE DUOPOLY IN A CINEMATIC SATIRICAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our two heroes\u2019 journey in a heartfelt, funny, satirical story about consumerism, duopoly and waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/40ab21aa9ab0b09540bb58c6bedb2bdf.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL FEATURED LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finished the story? Make your own! Create an infinite number of levels and challenge your friends with fiendish shopping cart puzzles of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/1883880068982000a83c4bd9754edf5a.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMING FOR CHANGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to Clean Up Australia</strong> or an equivalent charity for international players. The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/0c7cce124108d502a76329b78dc21e40.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy two empires and smash the duopoly in an adorable, quirky puzzle adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world dominated by <strong>Alphabarn</strong> and <strong>Omegamart</strong>, the twin supermarket overlords of <i>Duopolis</i>, a shopping cart awakens to find themselves abandoned, like so many others - destined to be destroyed and replaced. Teaming up with scrappy, an abandoned receipt, they begin their quest to <i>free</i> <i>all cartkind</i> from the devious plans of the evil duopoly and <strong>forge their own path to freedom.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 LEVELS OF COZY, TURN-BASED PUZZLE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 5 different regions of Duopolis - each with their own quirks, characters and challenges. From the forest to the carpark, the supermarket to the sewers and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/a6c5a9c641ce125a5718e2fa6e205fd5.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH THE DUOPOLY IN A CINEMATIC SATIRICAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our two heroes\u2019 journey in a heartfelt, funny, satirical story about consumerism, duopoly and waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/40ab21aa9ab0b09540bb58c6bedb2bdf.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL FEATURED LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finished the story? Make your own! Create an infinite number of levels and challenge your friends with fiendish shopping cart puzzles of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/1883880068982000a83c4bd9754edf5a.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMING FOR CHANGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to Clean Up Australia</strong> or an equivalent charity for international players. The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/0c7cce124108d502a76329b78dc21e40.avif?t=1755489036\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A narrative turn-based puzzle adventure about an abandoned shopping cart who defies two empires and sparks a revolution!",
